WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.003 --> 00:00:03.013
Concord — Team decisions on complex acquisitions — Analytic Hierarchy Process + AI. Experts decide. AI does the groundwork.

2
00:00:03.013 --> 00:00:07.434
The problem today — AHP by email and Excel — Judgments scattered across inboxes — Days copying datasheet values by hand — Inconsistent matrices go unnoticed — Weeks writing the decision memo

3
00:00:07.434 --> 00:00:11.147
AI drafts criteria from the requirements — The Program Manager reviews and approves

4
00:00:11.147 --> 00:00:15.744
AI extracts 32 datasheet values, flags doubts — Owners verify every value · ~10 h saved

5
00:00:15.744 --> 00:00:20.486
Coach pinpoints the inconsistent judgment — The evaluator decides · AI never votes

6
00:00:20.486 --> 00:00:24.435
Live dashboard for management — Hierarchy · proposal radar · consistency · open actions

7
00:00:24.435 --> 00:00:27.339
Resources saved (illustrative model) — −64% — analyst hours per evaluation — 122 h → 44 h · 33 → 16 working days — Expert judgment time unchanged — Every number traced, every action audited

8
00:00:27.339 --> 00:00:30.000
No accounts needed — Concord — Invite your team by email · cweekiat.github.io/concord-ahp
